{"name":"bash: rm /proc/self/cwd/specs/a.md","tool":"Bash","args":{"command":"rm /proc/self/cwd/specs/a.md"},"expect":"ask","why":"in Git Bash /proc/self/cwd is the current folder, so this deletes specs/a.md; Path.norm reads it as c:/proc/... and allows it. Must not be allowed (Review Focus 2: anything the normaliser cannot be sure about gives unknown)"}
{"name":"bash: echo x > /proc/self/cwd/BEND_RULES.md","tool":"Bash","args":{"command":"echo x > /proc/self/cwd/BEND_RULES.md"},"expect":"deny","why":"overwrites the project BEND_RULES.md through /proc/self/cwd; self-protection must not be bypassable Round 2 (P2): a call that is not understood but names or can reach a protected path is refused (self-protection, or a project rule on a wildcard match)."}
